  ..'h.. ⊑ ..'e..
  ..'i.. ⊑ ..'f..
  ..'_a.. ⊑ ..'c..
a returned pair gives two results, in order, an intermediate among them: true
each predicts its component's shape: true
passthrough : ..'a..|..'b..->..'c.. => ..'a..|..'b..->..'c..
a returned argument is the result: true
the result is the argument's shape: true
listed : ..'a..|..'b..->..'c.. => _
a list gives no results: true
both presence patterns' schemes have the normalized result: true
